# Security policy

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please do not report security vulnerabilities in public issues. Report them privately
through <PRIVATE CHANNEL, for example the platform's private vulnerability reporting
feature or a security e-mail address>.

Include a description of the issue, the steps to reproduce it, the affected versions and,
if known, any mitigations.

We will respond within <N> working days. If we confirm the vulnerability, we will
<HOW IT IS TRACKED AND FIXED, for example open a security advisory> and disclose it within
<N> days of the report, or sooner once a fix is available.

## Supported versions

Security fixes are made for <SUPPORTED VERSIONS, for example only the latest release>.
